[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2103.589, "timestamp": "00:35:03", "text": "我的冲浪。 我超爱跑酷游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2106.069, "timestamp": "00:35:06", "text": "真好。 你可以通过移动做很多事情，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2110.79, "timestamp": "00:35:10", "text": "，是的，在目前的《使命召唤》中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2114.95, "timestamp": "00:35:14", "text": "，移动太多了。  Techna，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2119.109, "timestamp": "00:35:19", "text": "那也令人难过和痛苦。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2125.109, "timestamp": "00:35:25", "text": "好的，我们决定只用手枪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2132.47, "timestamp": "00:35:32", "text": "而且还有终结技。 你可以做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2136.39, "timestamp": "00:35:36", "text": "这就是我喜欢手枪的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2149.27, "timestamp": "00:35:49", "text": "我当时为什么走到后面去，而"}]